menuconfig PKG_USING_EPD_SDCARD
    bool "SD card media lifecycle service"
    depends on RT_USING_PIN && RT_USING_SDIO && BSP_USING_SD_LINE
    depends on RT_USING_DFS && RT_USING_DFS_ELMFAT
    depends on SDIO_CARD_MODE = 0 && SD_INSERT_DETECT_PIN >= 0
    default n
    help
        Manage SD card detection and DFS FAT mount/unmount from a worker.
        The platform supplies the card configuration and acknowledges release
        of media users before unmounting. Requires per-host change request
        status support in the SiFli MMC/SD core.

